{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39094","headline":"途中望雨怀归 · 韦庄","name":"途中望雨怀归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满空寒雨漫霏霏，去路云深锁翠微。\n牧竖远当烟草立，饥禽闲傍渚田飞。\n谁家树压红榴折，几处篱悬白菌肥。\n对此不堪乡外思，荷蓑遥羡钓人归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}